      "content": "Your pain is valid, and the feeling that \"you\" died is a common and heavy experience for those struggling with severe depression or dissociation. You are not alone in feeling this way, and please know that you do not have to \"just exist\" to be loved or help. I encourage you to reach out to a mental health professional or a crisis line today to help you find safe space and support.",
      "source": "target",
